{"id":"712284ecd096f2e3","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-ord-closed-subset.md","title":"ZFC Ord Closed Subset","display":"df-zfc-ord-closed-subset — ZFC Ord Closed Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ord-closed-subset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ord-closed-subset"],"display":"df-zfc-ord-closed-subset — ZFC Ord Closed Subset","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-cofinal-subset.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ord-closed-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ord-closed-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ord-closed-subset — ZFC Ord Closed Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b025cdb34ece9c24\" href=\"?note=b025cdb34ece9c24\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-cofinal-subset.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-cofinal-subset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(C,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> are the ordinal and limit-ordinal predicates (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md\">../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdCofinalSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdCofinalSubset}_S\\)</span> is cofinality of a subset of an ordinal (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b025cdb34ece9c24\" href=\"?note=b025cdb34ece9c24\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-cofinal-subset.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-cofinal-subset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdClosedSubset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrdCofinalSubset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdClosedSubset}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcOrdCofinalSubset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ord\\text{-}closed\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdClosedSubset}_S(C,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land C\\subseteq\\alpha\\land \\forall\\delta\\in\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrdCofinalSubset}_S(C\\cap\\delta,\\delta)\\to\\delta\\in C\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ord\\text{-}closed\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrdClosedSubset}_S(C,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land C\\subseteq\\alpha\\land \\forall\\delta\\in\\alpha\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcOrdCofinalSubset}_S(C\\cap\\delta,\\delta)\\to\\delta\\in C\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-cofinal-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"b025cdb34ece9c24","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-cofinal-subset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ are the ordinal and limit-ordinal predicates (see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]], [[../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-limitordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\m